"""Why: the COMBAT GIMMICK bases (125 mechanics once expanded): arena rules for a fight. The counter spawns the monsters of the fight (the wardens: kill them all, or kill the keystone)
and the effects are the RULE of the arena that applies to them: a leader that must die first, a shield that holds until a switch, reflected blows, waves on a timer, a cursed
weapon, a swarm that splits, an ambush from the dark. Room scope; the reward is experience. Variants change the rule's element, what starts it, and what ends the fight."""
